# Jira commit linking (SX-3624)

This repo is **Decoupled FARM**, tracked under:

- Parent: [SX-3624](https://kodiflylimited.atlassian.net/browse/SX-3624) — Breakdown, isolate, reproduce all components of FARM
- Umer's subtask: [SX-3625](https://kodiflylimited.atlassian.net/browse/SX-3625) — Phase 1: Stream, Segment, Embed

## Required on every commit

1. Start the subject with `SX-3624` so Jira development / smart commits attach to the **overarching** ticket (not only the subtask).
2. Pattern:

```
SX-3624 [RESEARCH] <imperative summary of this change>
```

3. Optionally mention `SX-3625` (or later phase keys) in the **body**, not instead of `SX-3624` on the first line.
4. Never commit without an `SX-` key.
5. After push, if the user asked for ticket progress, comment on SX-3624 and the relevant subtask with the commit SHA and GitHub URL.

GitHub repo: https://github.com/UmerRajaKodifly/Decoupled-FARM
